# Subagent model routing

Overrides all earlier per-task model locks.

- Heavy work: dispatch with `claude-fable-5-thinking-high`.
- Everything else: dispatch with `inherit` (session grok 4.6 extra high).
- Do not use composer-2.5. Do not auto-upgrade to fable xhigh.

Heavy work means: runtime adapter, physics, movement, camera, support-query integration; Task 6 (implement, review, re-review, fix); Task 7 when wiring Runtime `supported-by`; Task 8 adversarial/full gates; whole-branch review; M5 R1/R1b implement and review; any design/field freeze that binds runtime authority.

Light work means: isolated types, catalogs, admission tests, pure resolvers, small mechanical fixes, and small non-runtime task reviews.
